docs {
  # DocumentsService.GenerateSchedules

  Freezes a mode and target as a new version waiting for signatures (created false: nothing changed)

  `/ltedu.documents.v1.DocumentsService/GenerateSchedules` · unary · `ltedu/documents/v1/documents.proto`

  ## Request — `GenerateSchedulesRequest`

  | Campo | Tipo | Descripción |
  |---|---|---|
  | `institution_slug` | `string` |  |
  | `period_id` | `string` |  |
  | `mode` | `string` |  |
  | `target_id` | `string` |  |
  | `note` | `string` | What changed, for the history |

